Yup.  There is a luckstone at the bottom.  It is often locked away
behind a secret door.  Of course, since the gnomes live there all
the time, they already know about it.  So once in awhile, one of
them will carry it around for safe-keeping.

As far as the priestess: Don't you think You'd be upset if
someone tried to convert your altar?  There was a discussion
a little back about which order one should tackle priests and
altars.  I usually try to be nice to the locals -- even donate
a little cash to the cause if I'm in a generous mood.
